, letters, words or base pairs according to the application. The n-grams typically are collected from a text or speech corpus. When the items are words, n-grams may also be called shingles.[1]  An n-gram of size 1 is referred to as a \"unigram\"; size 2 is a \"bigram\" (or, less commonly, a \"digram\"); size 3 is a \"trigram\". Larger sizes are sometimes referred to by the value of n, e.g., \"four-gram\", \"five-gram\", and so on.","topics":[],"score":2300,"global_rank":116145},{"name":"leo237/fuzzyDecisionMaking","owner":"leo237","html_url":"https://github.com/leo237/fuzzyDecisionMaking","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2300,"global_rank":116156},{"name":"sealablab/DPD-001","owner":"sealablab","html_url":"https://github.com/sealablab/DPD-001","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Demo Probe Driver","topics":[],"score":2300,"global_rank":116159},{"name":"denised/pd-excel-tools","owner":"denised","html_url":"https://github.com/denised/pd-excel-tools","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Tools used to manage Excel->Python translation for PD","topics":[],"score":2300,"global_rank":116161},{"name":"Brets0150/mdx-agent","owner":"Brets0150","html_url":"https://github.com/Brets0150/mdx-agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Hashtopolis-compatible hash cracking agent powered by MDXfind ","topics":[],"score":2300,"global_rank":116167},{"name":"condongilbert/ChessPuzzleLichess","owner":"condongilbert","html_url":"https://github.com/condongilbert/ChessPuzzleLichess","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2300,"global_rank":116169},{"name":"jon-jacky/gr-mrfm","owner":"jon-jacky","html_url":"https://github.com/jon-jacky/gr-mrfm","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"FPGA-based ca